(Write 4 to 5 sentences in your own words: how RAG works, what broke, how you fixed it.)

## Known limitations
- Chunks are split by character count, so some cut mid-sentence
- Broad questions ("summarize this document") retrieve only the top 4 chunks
- Scanned PDFs without text are not supported